  "title": "The Exact Abelian Cayley Embedding Order of K₁,₁,₅",
  "batch_label": "52",
  "kind": "resolution-paper",
  "original_status": "proved",
  "scope": "Let eta(G) be the minimum order of a finite Abelian group Gamma for which G has an induced embedding into a simple undirected Cayley graph Cay(Gamma,S), with S=-S and 0 not in S, as frozen in source.md and interpreted in problem.md. Then eta(K_{1,1,5})=15. The lower bound covers every finite Abelian group of order below 15: Theorem 6 of the cited primary source excludes orders below 10, and exact exhaustive enumeration excludes Z10, Z11, Z12, Z2 x Z6, Z13, and Z14. The upper bound is the explicit verified Z15 certificate in evidence/order15-witness.json.",
